  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under Section 727(a) of the Bankruptcy Code, the court may deny the debtor''s entire discharge for misconduct including concealment of property, false oaths, and receiving a prior Chapter 7 discharge within eight years. Walters committed all three, warranting complete denial of discharge.
Wrong (A): Section 727 denial eliminates the entire discharge, not just individual debts; it is distinct from Section 523 nondischargeability, which exempts specific debts.
